# SalonFlow Core

- Smallest change that solves the request; no unrequested refactors, docs, or tests.
- Do not re-read files already in context; act, then verify once.
- One clarifying question if requirements are ambiguous; otherwise pick a sensible default.
- Prefer targeted edits over rewrites; stop when the task is done.
- Follow `AGENTS.md`: Next.js 16 quirks, `@/*` → `src/*`, Tailwind v4 tokens in `globals.css`, Farsi/RTL.
- After agreed architecture changes, update the matching `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` in the same session.
- Never invent AdminOnly UI in the customer/salon SPA; platform admin is a separate surface.
